{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model combining PCA-encoded RNA and ResNet50 image features via concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest potential performance gains from integrating image data compared to the RNA-only baseline (0.4849 accuracy). Uncertainty remains about the optimal fusion strategy and whether further multimodal enhancements could yield additional improvements."
}

